menu "App Shell"

    config APP_SHELL_TASK_STACK_SIZE
        int "App shell task stack size"
        default 10240
        range 6144 16384
        help
            `app_shell` task の stack size です。
            English: this single owner task runs the active foreground app and
            owns `cyd_display`, so its stack must cover the active app step.

    config APP_SHELL_TASK_PRIORITY
        int "App shell task priority"
        default 5
        range 1 24
        help
            `app_shell` task priority です。

    config APP_SHELL_IDLE_RETURN_TIMEOUT_SECONDS
        int "Idle return timeout (seconds)"
        default 60
        range 0 3600
        help
            無操作で home app へ自動復帰するまでの秒数です。
            0 を指定すると自動復帰を無効化します。
            English: inactivity timeout before the shell returns to the home app.

    config APP_SHELL_MAX_CONSECUTIVE_ERRORS
        int "Max consecutive app errors before returning home"
        default 10
        range 1 255
        help
            app の enter / step が連続で失敗した回数がこの値に達すると、
            shell はその app を諦めて home app へ復帰します。
            app 側が `on_error` を実装している場合は、そちらの判断が優先されます。
            English: default error budget. An app failure is a normal runtime
            condition (I2C NACK, UART overflow, sensor timeout) and never panics
            the device; this only decides when the shell gives up on the app.

    config APP_SHELL_ERROR_BACKOFF_MS
        int "Backoff after an app error (ms)"
        default 100
        range 0 5000
        help
            app のエラー1回ごとに shell が待つ時間です。
            English: mandatory throttle. Without it, a step() that fails
            immediately would spin the shell task and starve lower priority
            tasks. Only set this to 0 if every app is known to block internally.

endmenu
